      <<Do a binary search for $[[yb2(i2-1)]] \le [[y2]] < [[yb2(i2)]]$>>
      cir2dn = val(i1,i2,ic)
      <<Apply Jacobian for $y_1$ map>>
      <<Apply Jacobian for $y_2$ map>>
      <<Apply Jacobian for triangle map>>
